#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.pyscf_to_pennylane_hamiltonian_with_mm:1
msgid "Build PennyLane Hamiltonian with MM point charge embedding."
msgstr "构建带 MM 点电荷嵌入的 PennyLane 哈密顿量。"

#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.pyscf_to_pennylane_hamiltonian_with_mm:3
msgid ""
"Uses a perturbative approach: 1. Get vacuum Hamiltonian from molecular_hamiltonian (correct "
"eigenspectrum) 2. Compute MM corrections to single-electron integrals 3. Add MM correction as "
"Pauli operators to the vacuum Hamiltonian 4. Optionally apply energy shift for QPE precision "
"enhancement"
msgstr ""
"使用微扰方法：1. 从 molecular_hamiltonian 获取真空哈密顿量（具有正确的本征谱）；2. 计算单电子积分的 MM 修正；3. 将 MM 修正作为 Pauli "
"算符加入真空哈密顿量；4. 可选地施加能量平移，以提高 QPE 精度。"

#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.pyscf_to_pennylane_hamiltonian_with_mm:9
msgid ""
"This approach preserves the correct eigenspectrum structure from molecular_hamiltonian while "
"adding MM electrostatic effects."
msgstr "此方法在加入 MM 静电效应时，保留 molecular_hamiltonian 的正确本征谱结构。"

#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.pyscf_to_pennylane_hamiltonian_with_mm:12
msgid ""
"The energy_shift parameter enables \"shifted QPE\", where ``H' = H - E_ref * I``. This allows QPE"
" to measure ``ΔE = E - E_ref`` instead of absolute energy E, enabling higher precision for "
"detecting small energy changes (like MM effects) without phase overflow in QPE circuits."
msgstr ""
"energy_shift 参数启用“平移 QPE”，其中 ``H' = H - E_ref * I``。这使 QPE 测量 ``ΔE = E - E_ref``，而非绝对能量 "
"E，从而更精确地检测微小能量变化（例如 MM 效应），并避免 QPE 电路中的相位溢出。"

#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.estimate_qpe_resources:16
#: q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.pyscf_to_pennylane_hamiltonian_with_mm:19
msgid "Atomic coordinates in Angstrom, shape (n_atoms, 3)"
msgstr "以埃为单位的原子坐标，形状为 (n_atoms, 3)"

#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.pyscf_to_pennylane_hamiltonian_with_mm:20
msgid "Total molecular charge"
msgstr "分子总电荷"

#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.pyscf_to_pennylane_hamiltonian_with_mm:21
msgid "MM point charges array"
msgstr "MM 点电荷数组"

#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.estimate_qpe_resources:19
#: q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.pyscf_to_pennylane_hamiltonian_with_mm:22
msgid "MM charge coordinates in Angstrom, shape (n_mm, 3)"
msgstr "以埃为单位的 MM 电荷坐标，形状为 (n_mm, 3)"

#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.pyscf_to_pennylane_hamiltonian_with_mm:23
msgid "Number of active electrons"
msgstr "活性电子数"

#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.pyscf_to_pennylane_hamiltonian_with_mm:24
msgid "Number of active orbitals"
msgstr "活性轨道数"

#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.pyscf_to_pennylane_hamiltonian_with_mm:25
msgid ""
"Reference energy to subtract from Hamiltonian (optional). If provided, the returned Hamiltonian "
"is ``H' = H - E_shift * I``. This enables QPE to measure ``ΔE`` with higher precision."
msgstr "从哈密顿量中减去的参考能量（可选）。若提供此值，返回的哈密顿量为 ``H' = H - E_shift * I``。这使 QPE 能够以更高精度测量 ``ΔE``。"

#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.pyscf_to_pennylane_hamiltonian_with_mm:28
msgid ""
"MM embedding mode. ``\"diagonal\"`` preserves the historical Identity/Z coefficient update path. "
"``\"full_oneelectron\"`` adds the full fixed-MO one-electron perturbation as a fixed operator "
"Hamiltonian."
msgstr ""
"MM 嵌入模式。``\"diagonal\"`` 保留原有的 Identity/Z 系数更新路径。``\"full_oneelectron\"`` 将完整的固定 MO "
"单电子微扰作为固定算符哈密顿量加入。"

#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.build_qmmm_hamiltonian:1
msgid "Build QM/MM Hamiltonian with MM embedding using classical simulation."
msgstr "通过经典模拟构建带 MM 嵌入的 QM/MM 哈密顿量。"

#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.build_qmmm_hamiltonian:3
