msgstr "PySCF 分子对象"

#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.build_qmmm_hamiltonian:4
msgid "MM region point charges"
msgstr "MM 区域的点电荷"

#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.build_qmmm_hamiltonian:5
msgid "MM charge coordinates"
msgstr "MM 电荷坐标"

#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.build_qmmm_hamiltonian:7
msgid "Dictionary containing molecular data for QPE simulation"
msgstr "包含 QPE 模拟所需分子数据的字典"

#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.extract_molecular_orbitals:1
msgid "Extract molecular orbital coefficients from PySCF."
msgstr "从 PySCF 提取分子轨道系数。"

#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.extract_molecular_orbitals:3
msgid "PySCF RHF calculation result"
msgstr "PySCF RHF 计算结果"

#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.extract_molecular_orbitals:5
msgid "Copy of the MO coefficient matrix"
msgstr "分子轨道系数矩阵的副本"

#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.extract_molecular_orbitals:7
msgid "If scf_result is not a closed-shell RHF result"
msgstr "scf_result 不是闭壳层 RHF 结果"

#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.compute_overlap_integrals:1
msgid "Compute overlap integrals for Mulliken analysis."
msgstr "计算 Mulliken 分析所需的重叠积分。"

#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.compute_overlap_integrals:5
msgid "Overlap matrix"
msgstr "重叠矩阵"

#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.estimate_qpe_resources:1
msgid "Estimate EFTQC resources for QPE algorithm using PennyLane."
msgstr "使用 PennyLane 估计 QPE 算法的 EFTQC 资源。"

#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.estimate_qpe_resources:3
msgid ""
"Uses PennyLane's qml.estimator.DoubleFactorization to estimate quantum computing resources "
"(Toffoli gates and logical qubits) required for Quantum Phase Estimation on molecular systems."
msgstr "使用 PennyLane 的 qml.estimator.DoubleFactorization 估计分子系统量子相位估计所需的量子计算资源（Toffoli 门和逻辑量子比特）。"

#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.estimate_qpe_resources:7
msgid ""
"Supports both vacuum Hamiltonian and MM-embedded (solvated) Hamiltonian. When "
"mm_charges/mm_coords are provided, the single-electron integrals include QM-MM electrostatic "
"interaction terms. The default ``embedding_mode=\"full_oneelectron\"`` preserves the historical "
"resource-estimation behavior by adding the full fixed-MO active-space ``Delta h`` matrix. Use "
"``embedding_mode=\"diagonal\"`` to request the diagonal-only compatibility row used by the "
"current QPE coefficient path."
msgstr ""
"支持真空哈密顿量和 MM 嵌入（溶剂化）哈密顿量。提供 mm_charges/mm_coords 时，单电子积分包含 QM-MM 静电相互作用项。默认的 "
"``embedding_mode=\"full_oneelectron\"`` 通过加入完整的固定 MO 活性空间 ``Delta h`` 矩阵，保留原有的资源估计行为。使用 "
"``embedding_mode=\"diagonal\"`` 可请求仅含对角项的兼容结果，对应当前 QPE 系数路径。"

#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.estimate_qpe_resources:15
msgid "List of atomic symbols (e.g., ['O', 'H', 'H', 'H'])"
msgstr "原子符号列表，例如 ['O', 'H', 'H', 'H']"

#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.estimate_qpe_resources:17
msgid "Total molecular charge (default: 0 for neutral)"
msgstr "分子总电荷，默认为 0（中性）"

#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.estimate_qpe_resources:18
msgid "MM point charges array (optional, for solvated Hamiltonian)"
msgstr "MM 点电荷数组（可选，用于溶剂化哈密顿量）"

#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.estimate_qpe_resources:20
msgid "Number of electrons in active space (optional)"
msgstr "活性空间中的电子数（可选）"

#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.estimate_qpe_resources:21
msgid "Number of spatial orbitals in active space (optional)"
msgstr "活性空间中的空间轨道数（可选）"

#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.estimate_qpe_resources:22
msgid "Target energy error in Hartree (default: 0.0016 = 1 kcal/mol)"
msgstr "目标能量误差，单位为 Hartree（默认：0.0016 = 1 kcal/mol）"

#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.estimate_qpe_resources:23
msgid ""
"MM embedding mode for resource rows. ``\"full_oneelectron\"`` adds the full active-space "
"perturbation. ``\"diagonal\"`` adds only its diagonal. Ignored when no MM charges are provided, "
"but still validated."
msgstr ""
"资源结果的 MM 嵌入模式。``\"full_oneelectron\"`` 加入完整的活性空间微扰。``\"diagonal\"`` 仅加入其对角项。未提供 MM "
"电荷时忽略此参数，但仍验证其取值。"

#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.estimate_qpe_resources:28
msgid ""
"- logical_qubits: Number of logical qubits for EFTQC - toffoli_gates: Total Toffoli count for the"
" whole QPE run   (DoubleFactorization.gates = estimation_cost * unitary_cost) - "
"hamiltonian_1norm: Lambda (1-norm of Hamiltonian) in Hartree - qpe_iterations: Number of walk-"
"operator calls (= ceil(πλ/2ε)).   Informational only: these calls are already included in "
"toffoli_gates - trotter_steps: Recommended Trotter steps (heuristic: 10 × n_orbitals) - "
"target_error: Target error in Hartree - n_electrons: Number of electrons in the system - "
"n_orbitals: Number of spatial orbitals - basis: Basis set used - mm_embedded: Whether MM "
"embedding was applied - n_mm_charges: Number of MM point charges (0 if vacuum) - "
"active_electrons: Active-space electron count passed to the estimator - active_orbitals: Active-"
"space orbital count passed to the estimator - embedding_mode: Effective embedding state (\"none\""
" for vacuum) - requested_embedding_mode: Requested MM mode, or None for vacuum - fixed_mo: "
"Whether a fixed-MO MM perturbation was used - two_electron_tensor_fixed: Whether the two-electron"
" tensor is vacuum - active_indices: Vacuum MO indices included in the active space - delta_h_* "
"diagnostics for the MM one-electron perturbation"
msgstr ""
"- logical_qubits: EFTQC 的逻辑量子比特数 - toffoli_gates: 整次 QPE 运行的 Toffoli 总数 "
"(DoubleFactorization.gates = estimation_cost * unitary_cost) - hamiltonian_1norm: Lambda（哈密顿量的 "
"1-范数），单位为 Hartree - qpe_iterations: 游走算符调用次数 (= ceil(πλ/2ε))。仅供参考：这些调用已计入 toffoli_gates - "
"trotter_steps: 建议的 Trotter 步数（启发式：10 × n_orbitals） - target_error: 目标误差，单位为 Hartree - "
"n_electrons: 系统中的电子数 - n_orbitals: 空间轨道数 - basis: 使用的基组 - mm_embedded: 是否施加了 MM 嵌入 - "
"n_mm_charges: MM 点电荷数（真空时为 0） - active_electrons: 传给估计器的活性空间电子数 - active_orbitals: 传给估计器的活性空间轨道数 "
"- embedding_mode: 实际嵌入状态（真空时为 \"none\"） - requested_embedding_mode: 请求的 MM 模式，真空时为 None - "
"fixed_mo: 是否使用了固定 MO 的 MM 微扰 - two_electron_tensor_fixed: 双电子张量是否取自真空 - active_indices: 活性空间所含的真空"
" MO 索引 - delta_h_*：MM 单电子微扰的诊断信息"

#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.estimate_qpe_resources:28
msgid "logical_qubits: Number of logical qubits for EFTQC"
msgstr "logical_qubits: EFTQC 的逻辑量子比特数"

#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.estimate_qpe_resources:29
msgid ""
"toffoli_gates: Total Toffoli count for the whole QPE run (DoubleFactorization.gates = "
"estimation_cost * unitary_cost)"
msgstr "toffoli_gates: 整次 QPE 运行的 Toffoli 总数 (DoubleFactorization.gates = estimation_cost * unitary_cost)"

#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.estimate_qpe_resources:31
msgid "hamiltonian_1norm: Lambda (1-norm of Hamiltonian) in Hartree"
msgstr "hamiltonian_1norm: Lambda（哈密顿量的 1-范数），单位为 Hartree"

#: of q2m3.interfaces.pyscf_pennylane.PySCFPennyLaneConverter.estimate_qpe_resources:32
msgid ""
